d humanities. Main campus.\",\"price_range\":\"R10,000 - R35,000/year\",\"category\":\"education\"},{\"title\":\"Mall of the North — anchor tenant directory\",\"description\":\"Regional shopping centre with 200+ stores, food court, and cinema.\",\"price_range\":\"Varies\",\"category\":\"retail\"}]},{\"slug\":\"tzaneen\",\"name\":\"Tzaneen\",\"region\":\"Mopani · subtropical agriculture\",\"district\":\"Mopani\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":42,\"heritage\":false,\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/tzaneen\",\"illustrative\":true,\"lat\":-23.8167,\"lng\":30.1667,\"description\":\"In Limpopo's tropical lowveld, Tzaneen is surrounded by subtropical fruit farms, forests, and the stunning Magoebaskloof Pass. Tea, coffee, and avocado farms create a lush landscape unlike anywhere else in South Africa.\",\"population_estimate\":25000,\"archetype\":\"tropical\"},{\"slug\":\"thohoyandou\",\"name\":\"Thohoyandou\",\"region\":\"Vhembe · Venda capital\",\"district\":\"Vhembe\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":18,\"opportunity_potential\":40,\"heritage\":true,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/thohoyandou\",\"illustrative\":true,\"coordinator_name\":\"Mashudu Tshivhase\",\"youth_mapped\":34,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":2,\"lat\":-23.0833,\"lng\":29.4833,\"description\":\"The heart of Venda country, Thohoyandou was the capital of the former Venda homeland and remains the cultural centre of the Vhavenda people. The University of Venda and Phiphidi Waterfall are local landmarks.\",\"population_estimate\":80000,\"archetype\":\"cultural_hub\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-coord-thoh\",\"title\":\"Ubuntu Town Coordinator — Thohoyandou\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-thoh\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"coordinator\"}}],\"businesses\":[{\"slug\":\"thohoyandou\",\"name\":\"University of Venda\",\"category\":\"education\",\"is_verified\":false